            "description": "March 2004: You announced Tony Knowles as your runningmate. This was a surprising pick, partially because Knowles doesn't seem to offer much of an ideological balance. What would you say to critics who believe you could've done more to unite the party with a more progressive pick, especially considering his stance on gun control?"
