            "description": "July 2004: The campaign is really heating up. Now, Huckabee and his surrogates are making the case that we've essentially \"abandoned\" our ally Israel. They even went as far as producing an ad that shows a picture of you and Al Sharpton together, with one of his anti-semitic quotes on screen next to you. Obviously, this is a ridiculous ad. It's being put out by some PAC so Huckabee's name isn't even on it. Thing is though, his surrogates keep repeating the same line in interviews: \"When someone shows you who they are, believe them\". It's so obvious what they're doing and we need to hit back.\n"
