const _q374DealText = "May 2004: Several aid workers were killed by Israeli sniper fire in the occupied West Bank. According to the Israelis, the aid workers were communicating with Hamas fighters within Gaza. What we know for a fact is that 4 of the 5 men were Iraqis, and this threatens the foundation of the peace deal. Saddam is holding off on retaliation, but his backchannel is in communication with us. Netanyahu is furious, but luckily none of this has gone public yet. Bibi believes this is evidence of an Iraqi plot to undermine western influence in the region, and that Hamas is more than likely planning an attack in conjunction with the Iraqis. We need to intervene now before it's too late.";
